WEBVTT

00:01.644 --> 00:02.981
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.005 --> 00:04.340
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.364 --> 00:07.580
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.604 --> 00:13.164
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.164 --> 01:31.124
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.284 --> 01:34.524
=Episode 1=

01:38.049 --> 01:39.949
I'll do a drawing,

01:41.083 --> 01:42.964
and this is the Divine Land.

01:45.474 --> 01:46.474
North Mang

01:46.684 --> 01:48.483
rules the land of bitter cold.

01:49.124 --> 01:50.443
I'll put it aside.

01:50.774 --> 01:51.774
This is

01:52.374 --> 01:53.804
the Central Plains.

01:56.049 --> 01:58.600
(Liyang, North Mang)

01:58.624 --> 02:01.400
In those years, the world was in chaos.

02:01.424 --> 02:01.980
(West Chu)

02:02.004 --> 02:03.684
(South Tang, Dawei)
The land was fragmented

02:03.723 --> 02:05.524
(East Yue)
and the states were at war.

02:05.849 --> 02:07.674
(Post-Song)
The Divine Land was wobbling.

02:08.499 --> 02:09.499
(Liyang) Liyang

02:09.824 --> 02:10.924
(West Chu) broke through

02:11.099 --> 02:12.419
and wiped out the other eight states,

02:12.443 --> 02:14.500
(South Tang, Dawei)
uniting the world.

02:14.524 --> 02:15.925
(Post-Song)

02:15.949 --> 02:17.599
(West Shu)

02:18.443 --> 02:19.900
Especially the North Liang Cavalry

02:19.924 --> 02:21.323
of the Liyang Dynasty

02:22.163 --> 02:23.964
quelled the unrest

02:24.474 --> 02:25.644
and benefited the world

02:25.843 --> 02:26.843
in an invincible manner!

02:27.003 --> 02:27.763
One army

02:27.883 --> 02:29.003
wiped out six states!

02:33.649 --> 02:34.684
This is

02:35.374 --> 02:36.850
the majesty of the Lord of North Liang,

02:36.874 --> 02:38.460
(Xu Xiao, the Lord of North Liang)
Xu Xiao.

02:38.484 --> 02:39.750
(Xu Xiao, the Lord of North Liang)

02:39.774 --> 02:40.774
If it were not for him,

02:41.244 --> 02:42.244
the world

02:42.399 --> 02:44.259
would still be in chaos.

02:44.283 --> 02:45.699
(Liang)

03:27.499 --> 03:28.499
Now,

03:28.874 --> 03:29.883
Liyang rules all the land

03:30.524 --> 03:31.684
and Xu Xiao was made the lord

03:32.549 --> 03:34.299
to guard the three border states

03:34.404 --> 03:36.949
and lead the 350,000 soldiers
of North Liang

03:37.524 --> 03:39.484
to defend against enemy
in the wind and the snow.

03:41.849 --> 03:42.849
This is

03:43.404 --> 03:45.003
the most powerful official in Liyang,

03:45.684 --> 03:47.124
a lord not born in the royal family,

03:47.443 --> 03:48.524
Xu Xiao.

03:50.163 --> 03:51.299
You've probably heard of

03:52.224 --> 03:53.774
his reputation.

03:57.549 --> 03:58.924
Do you understand

04:00.299 --> 04:01.424
what I said?

04:11.249 --> 04:12.274
I'm the oldest son

04:13.524 --> 04:15.204
of the Lord of North Liang,

04:16.549 --> 04:18.099
the number one playboy in the world,

04:19.874 --> 04:20.874
Xu,

04:21.099 --> 04:22.099
Feng,

04:22.324 --> 04:23.324
Nian.

04:25.424 --> 04:27.649
(Xu Fengnian,
the Lord of North Liang's oldest son)

04:27.724 --> 04:29.700
Today I ate some of your sweet potatoes,

04:29.724 --> 04:30.324
one day,

04:30.649 --> 04:32.874
I'll pay you back
with a handsome reward.

04:34.074 --> 04:35.149
You can count on my word.

04:41.624 --> 04:43.399
(Old Huang, groom)

04:44.949 --> 04:46.260
Whoever steals my sweet potatoes
must pay the money!

04:46.284 --> 04:47.274
- I'm not...
- Don't run!

04:47.299 --> 04:48.419
- Danger!
- Wait, no...

04:48.443 --> 04:48.999
Stop!

04:49.449 --> 04:50.001
You...

04:50.025 --> 04:51.340
- Withdraw!
- I'm not...

04:51.364 --> 04:52.051
You...!

04:52.075 --> 04:53.324
Stop! Don't run!

04:57.349 --> 04:58.349
Put it down!

04:58.849 --> 05:00.949
Give yourself a chance.

05:01.549 --> 05:02.604
A couple of sweet potatoes

05:03.164 --> 05:05.074
can make you rich
for the rest of your life.

05:05.164 --> 05:06.164
I want money!

05:06.424 --> 05:07.780
I don't have any with me today.

05:07.804 --> 05:09.124
Then you are a thief!

05:10.849 --> 05:11.850
Hey, stop!

05:11.874 --> 05:12.501
I told you

05:12.525 --> 05:13.763
I don't have money today.

05:13.844 --> 05:14.859
I am the son of the Lord of North Liang.

05:14.883 --> 05:16.499
Do you think it's easy
to grow sweet potatoes?

05:16.523 --> 05:17.859
I just ate some sweet potatoes.

05:17.883 --> 05:19.020
It's not like I ate them for free.

05:19.044 --> 05:20.604
I'll pay you back one day!

05:20.724 --> 05:21.724
Stop!

05:23.403 --> 05:25.324
I have no money now!

05:25.604 --> 05:27.763
I'll give you the money one day!

05:33.099 --> 05:34.249
Wait for me!

05:34.649 --> 05:35.649
Wait for me!

05:42.749 --> 05:43.749
You...

05:43.949 --> 05:44.949
You...

05:46.424 --> 05:47.174
I...

05:47.349 --> 05:48.349
I...

05:49.244 --> 05:50.141
What are you trying to say?

05:50.165 --> 05:51.299
- Stop!
- I...

05:51.399 --> 05:51.924
I...

05:52.024 --> 05:52.660
Got it!

05:52.684 --> 05:54.059
I'll guard the sweet potato
with my life!

05:54.083 --> 05:55.475
Give me the money!

05:55.499 --> 05:56.499
Old Huang!

05:57.624 --> 05:58.624
Why...

05:59.274 --> 06:00.924
Why didn't I kill you before?

06:01.599 --> 06:03.224
Give me the money!

06:05.799 --> 06:06.799
Good horse.

06:07.049 --> 06:08.409
You are more loyal than Old Huang.

06:09.324 --> 06:10.324
Go on.

06:10.924 --> 06:12.274
Keep running.

06:15.299 --> 06:16.299
You...

06:18.724 --> 06:19.724
You brat...

06:20.124 --> 06:21.124
Stop!

06:23.949 --> 06:24.999
You stupid horse.

06:25.284 --> 06:26.724
Are you Old Huang's son?

06:26.774 --> 06:27.774
Wait.

06:28.324 --> 06:29.324
You...

06:30.003 --> 06:31.003
Run.

06:40.774 --> 06:41.774
Old Huang!

06:52.424 --> 06:53.584
Where are the sweet potatoes?

06:54.044 --> 06:55.574
You ate them all?

06:55.999 --> 06:57.449
I'm full.

07:04.699 --> 07:05.699
Young Master.

07:06.044 --> 07:07.244
Where are your sweet potatoes?

07:07.274 --> 07:08.484
I got caught.

07:09.849 --> 07:11.074
You didn't get beat up?

07:11.999 --> 07:13.100
I gave him the horse.

07:13.124 --> 07:14.949
You gave away the horse again?

07:15.364 --> 07:16.261
That fellow

07:16.285 --> 07:17.845
would stroll back by itself every time.

07:21.174 --> 07:22.600
And you!

07:22.624 --> 07:23.624
Eh?

07:23.684 --> 07:25.524
Why didn't you
save some sweet potatoes for me?

07:26.399 --> 07:27.824
I couldn't stop.

07:28.374 --> 07:29.374
Young Master.

07:29.399 --> 07:30.824
If you learn martial arts,

07:30.999 --> 07:32.599
he wouldn't be able
to catch up with you.

07:32.849 --> 07:33.849
I won't learn it.

07:41.624 --> 07:42.984
Young Master, where are you going?

07:43.474 --> 07:44.474
I'm hungry.

07:44.499 --> 07:45.579
I'll find something to eat.

07:46.399 --> 07:47.399
Young Master!

07:47.624 --> 07:49.220
You have nothing to lose

07:49.244 --> 07:50.724
by learning martial arts.

07:51.699 --> 07:52.699
Young Master.

07:56.799 --> 07:58.124
Old Huang!

07:58.524 --> 07:59.524
Here are fish.

07:59.899 --> 08:00.475
Right?

08:00.499 --> 08:01.499
I saw it.

08:07.974 --> 08:08.699
Young Master.

08:08.924 --> 08:09.924
You got it?

08:12.224 --> 08:13.200
It's so big.

08:13.224 --> 08:14.224
Yeah.

08:14.274 --> 08:15.824
This one is really big...!

08:17.824 --> 08:19.059
You finally got one!

08:19.083 --> 08:20.244
But you let it escape!

08:22.549 --> 08:23.549
Old Huang!

08:26.044 --> 08:27.044
It's too slippery.

08:46.999 --> 08:47.700
Hey.

08:47.724 --> 08:48.724
Do you want meat?

08:49.964 --> 08:50.964
Yeah.

08:51.999 --> 08:53.675
There's a deserted temple
five miles ahead.

08:53.699 --> 08:54.699
Follow us

08:54.883 --> 08:55.499
and I'll give you meat.

08:55.523 --> 08:56.523
All right.

09:01.574 --> 09:02.683
Take care, sir!

09:12.399 --> 09:13.839
There are signs of battle formation.

09:14.149 --> 09:15.789
They don't look like
normal horse bandits.

09:16.099 --> 09:16.739
What do you think?

09:16.763 --> 09:17.763
Young Master.

09:18.224 --> 09:19.763
You can't fight.

09:20.149 --> 09:21.564
Let's avoid them.

09:24.274 --> 09:25.181
You can avoid them.

09:25.205 --> 09:26.274
I want meat.

09:29.324 --> 09:30.549
I want meat, too.

09:31.774 --> 09:32.949
Come on, cheers!

09:34.349 --> 09:35.251
If you want meat,

09:35.275 --> 09:36.350
hear the rules first!

09:36.374 --> 09:38.364
Remember this name,

09:38.824 --> 09:39.824
Xu Fengnian.

09:40.124 --> 09:42.403
This guy should be well-dressed.

09:42.549 --> 09:43.674
He is heading for the north.

09:43.924 --> 09:45.249
I want you to stay alert!

09:46.424 --> 09:47.619
Report to me immediately

09:47.643 --> 09:48.700
if you see anyone like him!

09:48.724 --> 09:49.875
There will be a handsome reward

09:49.899 --> 09:51.003
if you find him.

09:51.249 --> 09:51.899
Did you get it?

09:51.999 --> 09:52.650
Got it.

09:52.674 --> 09:53.674
Well-dressed Xu Fengnian.

09:59.399 --> 10:00.399
Hey.

10:01.099 --> 10:02.099
Get into the temple.

10:02.274 --> 10:03.274
Someone wants to see you.

10:25.174 --> 10:27.649
(Chu)

10:43.974 --> 10:45.749
The guy we're looking for, Xu Fengnian,

10:45.874 --> 10:48.155
is the legitimate son of Xu Xiao,
the Lord of North Liang.

10:48.774 --> 10:49.675
Three years ago,

10:49.699 --> 10:51.574
he left North Liang
to travel around the world.

10:51.724 --> 10:52.774
I got news recently

10:53.124 --> 10:54.624
that he is going back to North Liang.

10:56.224 --> 10:57.224
I see.

10:59.624 --> 11:00.624
I find it coincidental

11:02.199 --> 11:03.799
that you are about the same age

11:04.024 --> 11:05.424
of Xu Fengnian.

11:06.024 --> 11:07.224
It's coincidental indeed.

11:22.799 --> 11:23.924
You are slow in reaction.

11:29.024 --> 11:30.019
You didn't learn martial arts?

11:30.043 --> 11:31.283
Would I end up like this

11:31.724 --> 11:33.449
if I learned martial arts?

11:42.074 --> 11:43.180
You are about his age.

11:43.204 --> 11:44.204
I have to give it a try.

11:48.964 --> 11:50.244
Is Xu Fengnian good at fighting?

11:50.674 --> 11:51.699
He is Xu Xiao's son.

11:51.899 --> 11:53.179
It would be strange if he isn't.

11:59.899 --> 12:01.399
Why aren't you scared at all

12:01.474 --> 12:03.425
when you heard the name
of the Lord of North Liang?

12:03.449 --> 12:04.449
I feel scared inside.

12:05.699 --> 12:06.899
You don't change color

12:06.923 --> 12:08.443
in the face of a horse bandit's sword.

12:08.643 --> 12:09.683
That's not normal.

12:11.024 --> 12:12.674
I know you're not a horse bandit.

12:13.799 --> 12:15.049
Who am I then?

12:20.499 --> 12:21.674
I know

12:22.449 --> 12:23.449
this flag.

12:23.624 --> 12:24.774
Tell me about it.

12:25.699 --> 12:28.244
This is the military flag
of the Halberd Troops of West Chu.

12:29.924 --> 12:31.324
In the Jinghe Battle,

12:32.849 --> 12:34.259
120,000 soldiers

12:34.283 --> 12:35.374
were annihilated,

12:36.249 --> 12:37.524
thus West Chu

12:39.424 --> 12:40.803
perished.

12:41.149 --> 12:42.274
How could you know that?

12:42.649 --> 12:43.649
My father

12:44.574 --> 12:46.163
told me not to forget this flag.

12:49.574 --> 12:50.574
Are you

12:52.899 --> 12:53.999
also from Chu?

12:57.149 --> 12:58.799
Are you one of the Halberd Troops?

13:01.049 --> 13:02.049
Little brother.

13:02.249 --> 13:03.139
What's your name?

13:03.163 --> 13:04.163
I...

13:08.124 --> 13:09.124
My country

13:10.249 --> 13:11.799
was defeated and my clan slaughtered.

13:13.199 --> 13:16.099
You and I are just wandering ghosts.

13:17.424 --> 13:18.923
I don't have a name anymore.

13:31.249 --> 13:32.249
Yeah.

13:34.424 --> 13:35.799
You and I are

13:36.174 --> 13:37.699
just ghosts.

13:53.324 --> 13:54.324
Watch your words.

13:57.524 --> 13:58.524
How's it?

14:01.999 --> 14:03.749
They're here to kill me.

14:06.549 --> 14:07.549
Are you all right?

14:09.523 --> 14:10.964
He thought I'm also from Chu.

14:11.399 --> 14:12.399
The leader

14:12.524 --> 14:14.283
is crying inside.

14:15.324 --> 14:16.474
Young Master.

14:16.674 --> 14:18.950
You have nothing to lose
by learning martial arts.

14:18.974 --> 14:19.974
Stop nagging me.

14:25.224 --> 14:27.249
Why don't you eat the bowl, too?

14:29.424 --> 14:30.874
A pinch of salt

14:30.964 --> 14:32.180
makes it smell good

14:32.204 --> 14:33.379
and gives you strength.

14:33.403 --> 14:34.403
I added salt for you.

14:34.924 --> 14:35.924
Slow down.

14:36.149 --> 14:37.175
It's all yours.

14:37.199 --> 14:38.199
Um.

14:42.774 --> 14:44.974
(Chu)

14:45.599 --> 14:47.549
(Chu)

15:24.899 --> 15:31.899
(Chu)

15:38.274 --> 15:39.299
Those soldiers of Chu

15:39.444 --> 15:41.883
even paid beggars to be their informers.

15:42.084 --> 15:44.180
Thank God I'm smart.

15:44.204 --> 15:45.224
Yeah, yeah.

15:47.199 --> 15:48.249
What are you looking at?

15:49.874 --> 15:51.049
Our horse

15:51.199 --> 15:51.740
should be back

15:51.764 --> 15:53.244
by now.

15:53.649 --> 15:55.060
That stupid horse is like a ghost.

15:55.084 --> 15:56.084
Don't worry about it.

15:56.974 --> 15:58.580
Let's hurry back to Lingzhou.

15:58.604 --> 15:59.604
Yes, yes.

16:03.923 --> 16:05.124
Is that our horse?

16:11.849 --> 16:12.874
It is.

16:13.274 --> 16:14.449
That fellow.

16:14.849 --> 16:16.224
It's ahead of us.

16:19.524 --> 16:20.124
Sit down!

16:20.299 --> 16:21.299
Sit down!

16:22.599 --> 16:23.849
Keep your voice down.

16:23.899 --> 16:24.425
Got it.

16:24.449 --> 16:25.101
Nice to meet you.

16:25.125 --> 16:26.149
Xu Fengnian!

16:39.484 --> 16:40.820
Xu Fengnian?

16:40.844 --> 16:41.844
Yeah.

16:43.449 --> 16:45.274
Xu Fengnian is a horse.

16:45.599 --> 16:46.699
What a surprise.

16:47.174 --> 16:48.224
On the tree.

16:48.799 --> 16:49.799
Oh.

16:50.043 --> 16:51.043
Get down.

16:52.874 --> 16:53.999
The age is right.

16:54.199 --> 16:55.224
He is also going north.

16:56.024 --> 16:57.699
He might be Xu Fengnian.

16:57.849 --> 16:58.849
Yeah.

16:58.949 --> 16:59.975
- Report to Master now.
- Yes.

16:59.999 --> 17:00.999
Let's keep watch here.

17:06.699 --> 17:07.325
Don't move!

17:07.349 --> 17:07.825
Yes.

17:07.849 --> 17:08.849
Don't move!

18:38.024 --> 18:38.804
Young Master.

18:39.024 --> 18:40.024
What should we do?

18:42.374 --> 18:43.374
Let's escape.

18:44.074 --> 18:45.274
What about that guy?

18:45.899 --> 18:47.425
He's not me.
He'll be fine after he explains it.

18:47.449 --> 18:47.925
Let's go.

18:47.949 --> 18:48.650
Young Master.

18:48.924 --> 18:51.004
Let's watch it. It would help you
learn martial arts.

18:51.723 --> 18:53.474
I'm not interested in fighting.

19:00.174 --> 19:01.324
What's your name?

19:06.483 --> 19:07.549
Is your surname Xu?

19:23.723 --> 19:24.449
Stop!

19:24.699 --> 19:25.774
I'm asking you!

21:20.774 --> 21:21.651
I was passing by.

21:21.675 --> 21:22.949
I'm not one of them.

21:31.899 --> 21:32.799
You were

21:32.899 --> 21:33.899
awesome.

21:59.324 --> 22:00.180
Look at that stupid horse.

22:00.204 --> 22:01.274
How does it go with her?

22:05.424 --> 22:06.174
Old Huang.

22:06.349 --> 22:07.349
Ah.

22:07.574 --> 22:08.899
Is that a guy or a girl?

22:11.199 --> 22:13.049
I'm not very experienced.

22:14.599 --> 22:16.524
Does she look like a fox?

22:32.349 --> 22:33.483
She's also going north.

22:39.499 --> 22:41.049
It's the portrait of Xu Fengnian.

22:41.674 --> 22:42.723
They just sent it over.

22:45.574 --> 22:46.924
Xu Fengnian!

22:50.349 --> 22:51.349
Hey!

22:51.549 --> 22:52.274
Hey!

22:52.424 --> 22:53.424
Please stay.

22:55.874 --> 22:56.874
Don't get me wrong.

22:57.374 --> 22:58.374
We are also

22:58.424 --> 22:59.424
on our way.

23:00.449 --> 23:02.349
I just want to give you a heads-up

23:02.574 --> 23:04.524
that if anyone comes after you later,

23:04.564 --> 23:06.324
just tell him your name
and you'll be fine,

23:06.999 --> 23:08.319
unless your last name is also Xu.

23:09.349 --> 23:10.349
Do you get it?

23:13.249 --> 23:14.599
Anyway, I told you. Let's go.

23:14.699 --> 23:15.699
Oh.

23:27.499 --> 23:28.499
Hold on.

23:29.674 --> 23:30.674
Let me try again.

23:45.124 --> 23:46.475
What a stupid horse.

23:46.499 --> 23:47.499
Come on.

23:49.199 --> 23:50.299
It has been three years.

23:50.549 --> 23:51.824
The horse is also old.

23:52.249 --> 23:53.649
It depends on its mood.

23:54.424 --> 23:55.260
I think...

23:55.284 --> 23:55.781
Eh.

23:55.805 --> 23:57.044
This stupid horse is your son.

23:57.199 --> 23:58.403
I have a son now.

24:14.749 --> 24:16.499
- Stop!
- Stop!

24:18.599 --> 24:19.599
Stop!

24:20.649 --> 24:21.649
Stop! Don't run!

24:32.599 --> 24:33.599
Sir.

24:33.899 --> 24:34.924
We meet again.

24:35.774 --> 24:36.874
Have you found Xu Fengnian?

24:39.549 --> 24:41.099
You are Xu Xiao's son!

24:42.399 --> 24:44.284
You must be joking with me.

25:00.049 --> 25:01.489
I didn't see the portrait yesterday.

25:02.524 --> 25:03.524
They just sent it over.

25:03.824 --> 25:05.243
Your time is up.

25:05.674 --> 25:06.374
Where did you get it?

25:06.549 --> 25:08.764
Among 350,000 men in Xu's cavalry,

25:08.924 --> 25:09.964
there will always be a few

25:10.274 --> 25:11.474
who want you dead.

25:13.949 --> 25:15.723
It was from the North Liang Army.

25:16.474 --> 25:17.474
Xu Fengnian!

25:17.824 --> 25:18.874
My country fell.

25:19.499 --> 25:21.299
I'll use your head as an offering today.

25:22.403 --> 25:23.459
I was just a child

25:23.483 --> 25:24.524
when West Chu fell.

25:24.974 --> 25:25.899
I didn't fight in the war.

25:25.923 --> 25:26.781
Yes, yes.

25:26.805 --> 25:28.125
Xu Xiao killed countless enemies.

25:28.174 --> 25:29.540
He is known as the Human Slayer.

25:29.564 --> 25:30.804
You'll pay your father's debts.

25:31.174 --> 25:32.174
Just blame yourself

25:32.699 --> 25:34.443
for being born in the wrong family.

25:34.474 --> 25:36.604
You should get revenge on Xu Xiao!

25:36.643 --> 25:37.643
That's right.

25:43.349 --> 25:44.349
He is scared?

25:44.524 --> 25:45.524
It's possible.

25:45.549 --> 25:46.749
Cut it out!

25:48.574 --> 25:49.899
Old Huang is just a groom.

25:49.923 --> 25:51.283
He has nothing to do with Xu Xiao.

25:51.349 --> 25:53.364
Xu's groom should also die.

25:53.849 --> 25:54.849
Old Huang, go now.

25:57.924 --> 25:58.924
Sir.

26:00.449 --> 26:01.524
Can you give me a chance?

26:02.624 --> 26:04.649
I want to forsake darkness
for light today.

26:05.774 --> 26:07.049
I also want to kill Xu Xiao.

26:17.074 --> 26:18.699
I'll pay for my life!

26:19.124 --> 26:20.175
As long as you can save me,

26:20.199 --> 26:21.239
I'll let you make a price!

26:26.274 --> 26:27.299
Listen.

26:28.124 --> 26:29.459
I will kill Xu Xiao,

26:29.483 --> 26:32.139
but I'll kill his children first

26:32.163 --> 26:33.604
and take all hope from him.

26:37.364 --> 26:38.899
A coward has a lot of excuses.

26:39.549 --> 26:40.629
You are seeking your death!

26:54.749 --> 26:55.749
Who are you?

27:03.074 --> 27:04.624
What's your relationship with Xu Xiao?

27:08.374 --> 27:09.374
He is my father.

27:13.624 --> 27:15.304
Are you the son
of the Lord of North Liang?

27:16.774 --> 27:18.274
I look noble when I'm cleaned up.

27:18.549 --> 27:19.549
Xu Xiao is brutal!

27:19.749 --> 27:20.909
He is the enemy of the world!

27:21.449 --> 27:22.874
If you make way for me today,

27:23.174 --> 27:24.549
I'll owe you one!

27:41.749 --> 27:42.749
If I save your life,

27:48.674 --> 27:50.084
you let me in Tingchao Pavilion.

27:51.499 --> 27:52.499
Okay.

27:58.524 --> 27:59.524
You go first.

28:00.099 --> 28:01.099
Old Huang.

28:02.424 --> 28:03.774
Have you made up your mind?

28:04.049 --> 28:05.349
This is none of your business!

28:08.004 --> 28:09.004
Good.

28:09.199 --> 28:10.199
In that case,

28:10.524 --> 28:11.524
bros.

28:11.574 --> 28:12.799
Kill them all!

28:22.084 --> 28:23.084
Cool.

28:26.174 --> 28:27.399
What should I call you?

28:27.824 --> 28:28.824
Whatever you want.

28:28.974 --> 28:29.550
Old Huang.

28:29.574 --> 28:30.026
Ah?

28:30.050 --> 28:31.199
Does she look like a fox?

28:33.899 --> 28:36.024
She has a white face and white hands.

28:37.549 --> 28:39.699
I'll call you

28:39.849 --> 28:41.149
White Fox then.

28:43.074 --> 28:44.875
I can call you something else
if you don't like it.

28:44.899 --> 28:46.349
Are you really Xu Xiao's son?

28:46.549 --> 28:48.574
You'll know

28:48.849 --> 28:50.364
after you send me back to Lingzhou

28:50.949 --> 28:52.829
and we enter
the Mansion of Lord of North Liang.

28:57.524 --> 28:58.874
It's a deal then.

28:59.299 --> 29:00.539
That's what I'm gonna call you.

29:01.604 --> 29:03.549
Why do you have a long sword
and a short one?

29:06.974 --> 29:09.149
I didn't see you
draw two swords just now.

29:11.324 --> 29:12.699
They don't deserve it.

29:13.124 --> 29:14.874
What kind of people deserve it then?

29:22.699 --> 29:23.699
Get them!

29:45.524 --> 29:46.524
Do you want some?

29:54.474 --> 29:56.324
Why are you going to Tingchao Pavilion?

29:58.874 --> 30:00.634
Xu Xiao has been everywhere
around the world.

30:00.824 --> 30:03.075
I heard that Tingchao Pavilion collected
all kinds of books on martial arts.

30:03.099 --> 30:05.060
You're already skillful in martial arts.

30:05.084 --> 30:06.204
Why do you need those books?

30:07.124 --> 30:08.124
I'm not good enough.

30:09.724 --> 30:11.424
How good do you want to be?

30:15.549 --> 30:16.549
Don't move.

30:40.824 --> 30:41.824
Let's keep eating.

30:52.299 --> 30:53.299
Is it them again?

30:54.774 --> 30:55.899
They are lying up there.

30:56.149 --> 30:57.269
They can't move for a while.

30:58.149 --> 30:59.349
Even you can't fight,

31:00.024 --> 31:01.574
you can kill them easily.

31:05.174 --> 31:06.624
You want me to kill them?

31:07.549 --> 31:08.549
It's up to you.

31:08.624 --> 31:09.624
Never mind.

31:09.999 --> 31:11.024
Let them live.

31:12.849 --> 31:14.049
Are you afraid to kill people?

31:15.049 --> 31:16.049
No.

31:17.799 --> 31:19.459
Xu Xiao annihilated their country

31:19.483 --> 31:20.380
and they hate Xu Xiao.

31:20.404 --> 31:21.484
It's a grudge between them.

31:22.374 --> 31:23.500
I'm not that stupid

31:23.524 --> 31:25.124
to take on their grudge.

31:25.924 --> 31:27.060
Your father is Xu Xiao.

31:27.084 --> 31:27.980
He is who he is.

31:28.004 --> 31:29.004
I am who I am.

31:33.699 --> 31:34.699
What?

31:44.199 --> 31:45.599
This sword is called Xiudong.

31:46.124 --> 31:47.444
It's three feet, two inches long.

31:48.203 --> 31:49.683
It weighs ten catties and nine taels.

31:50.399 --> 31:51.624
The edge is blunt,

31:52.049 --> 31:53.174
as the way in the world.

31:59.524 --> 32:00.999
This sword is called Chunlei.

32:01.299 --> 32:02.849
It's two feet, four inches long.

32:03.724 --> 32:05.524
It weighs one catty and three taels.

32:06.174 --> 32:07.725
When a hair falls on it,
it can cut it in half.

32:07.749 --> 32:08.874
It's the sharpest sword,

32:11.499 --> 32:12.699
as the evil hearts of humans.

32:13.824 --> 32:14.874
What do you mean?

32:15.849 --> 32:17.125
I don't kill,

32:17.149 --> 32:18.449
so I deserve to see your swords?

32:18.599 --> 32:19.599
Go to sleep.

32:19.799 --> 32:20.799
I'll keep watch.

32:22.799 --> 32:24.999
Are you guys all like this?

32:28.374 --> 32:29.774
Go to sleep, Young Master.

32:33.524 --> 32:34.524
Okay.

32:42.674 --> 32:44.467
I wonder what the jackass Wenhua

32:44.491 --> 32:45.899
is doing.

32:58.199 --> 32:59.199
I can't sleep.

32:59.674 --> 33:00.740
How about

33:00.764 --> 33:01.764
I sing a song

33:01.999 --> 33:02.999
for you?

33:03.599 --> 33:04.599
Okay.

33:11.974 --> 33:15.364
♪ Old dog Old dog ♪

33:15.599 --> 33:17.659
That's all you can sing?

33:17.683 --> 33:20.449
♪ There is no dog like you ♪

33:21.274 --> 33:22.500
All right, go ahead.

33:22.524 --> 33:25.100
♪ Buried in the earth ♪

33:25.124 --> 33:27.604
You hold a wooden box
like a treasure all day.

33:27.643 --> 33:29.999
It turns out you are a crooner.

33:31.524 --> 33:35.549
♪ Old dog Old dog ♪

33:36.299 --> 33:39.604
♪ There is no dog like you ♪

33:40.974 --> 33:44.923
♪ You lost your tail ♪

33:45.874 --> 33:48.499
♪ And you can't find ♪

33:49.243 --> 33:53.874
♪ Your way back home ♪

35:04.874 --> 35:05.999
Do you have anything to say?

35:06.349 --> 35:07.924
Let's get on the road back to Lingzhou.

35:08.149 --> 35:09.149
What about her?

35:09.424 --> 35:10.824
A person's mind is unpredictable.

35:11.949 --> 35:13.739
She can kill me with her sword.

35:13.763 --> 35:14.843
There's no need to save me.

35:14.999 --> 35:17.049
I'm afraid you are not the one
she wants to kill.

35:18.174 --> 35:19.140
You mean

35:19.164 --> 35:21.044
she wants to get in the mansion
to kill Xu Xiao?

35:21.699 --> 35:23.299
You can never be too careful.

35:25.049 --> 35:26.723
Isn't she skillful in martial arts?

35:26.874 --> 35:28.634
How come she doesn't even know
we're leaving?

35:30.074 --> 35:30.980
Do you remember

35:31.004 --> 35:32.004
the knockout drops

35:32.163 --> 35:33.339
we stole from the gangster inn

35:33.363 --> 35:34.524
last time?

35:35.849 --> 35:37.203
I put some

35:37.363 --> 35:38.363
into the sweet potato.

35:38.524 --> 35:39.524
Old Huang!

35:39.749 --> 35:40.860
Let's go now. She's fine.

35:40.884 --> 35:41.779
She'll wake up.

35:41.803 --> 35:42.803
Hurry.

35:44.924 --> 35:49.079
(The Mansion of Lord of North Liang,
Lingzhou)

35:50.099 --> 35:52.399
(The Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

35:52.783 --> 35:55.834
(Xu Longxiang, the second son
of the Lord of North Liang)

35:55.858 --> 35:56.604
Your Highness.

35:56.849 --> 35:57.725
It's getting cold.

35:57.749 --> 35:58.909
Let's go back to the mansion.

35:59.324 --> 35:59.850
Yeah.

35:59.874 --> 36:00.739
His Lordship

36:00.763 --> 36:01.763
is still looking for you.

36:02.049 --> 36:03.049
It has been three years.

36:03.649 --> 36:04.824
My brother's coming home.

36:05.899 --> 36:07.024
I'll wait for him.

36:22.074 --> 36:23.114
There is a mouthful of it.

36:23.924 --> 36:25.224
Only a mouthful of it?

36:31.574 --> 36:32.421
It's not a mouthful.

36:32.445 --> 36:33.724
There are just a few drops.

36:40.724 --> 36:41.724
Young Master.

36:41.974 --> 36:44.420
We are at the border of Lingzhou.

36:44.444 --> 36:44.981
Keep going.

36:45.005 --> 36:46.100
Come on. Let's go.

36:46.124 --> 36:47.124
I can't.

36:47.243 --> 36:48.363
I've been walking all night.

36:49.349 --> 36:50.500
Let's take a break at the wine shop.

36:50.524 --> 36:51.524
Ah.

36:58.049 --> 36:59.949
(Apricot Flower Wine Shop)

37:12.299 --> 37:13.874
It's the smell of North Liang.

37:14.249 --> 37:16.624
It smells so good!

37:16.974 --> 37:17.626
Waiter!

37:17.650 --> 37:18.724
Bring wine!

37:18.799 --> 37:19.799
Coming!

37:26.549 --> 37:27.549
Sirs.

37:28.099 --> 37:30.024
Our signature apricot flower wine

37:30.474 --> 37:31.674
is 20 pennies a pot.

37:31.774 --> 37:32.474
It's not expensive,

37:32.674 --> 37:33.974
but not cheap, either.

37:34.323 --> 37:35.323
Put it on my tab.

37:35.574 --> 37:36.779
Someone will bring the money later.

37:36.803 --> 37:37.649
You'll have a tip, too.

37:37.749 --> 37:38.749
Put it on your tab?

37:38.799 --> 37:39.799
Sir.

37:40.099 --> 37:42.099
Are you drunk before you start to drink?

37:42.649 --> 37:43.299
It's a small business.

37:43.323 --> 37:44.323
No credit here.

37:45.999 --> 37:46.999
Waiter!

37:49.474 --> 37:50.599
Bring them wine!

37:50.974 --> 37:51.924
Bring them the best wine!

37:51.974 --> 37:52.974
Yeah.

37:57.324 --> 37:58.324
What a shame.

37:58.749 --> 38:00.074
You are so close to Lingzhou,

38:00.324 --> 38:01.524
but you can't go back.

38:07.149 --> 38:08.884
Thanks for buying me a drink.

38:16.624 --> 38:18.049
It smells good!

38:19.024 --> 38:20.420
Old Huang, why do you always
want my stuff?

38:20.444 --> 38:21.339
All right.

38:21.363 --> 38:22.363
Don't spill it.

38:22.549 --> 38:23.549
Drink the wine

38:23.723 --> 38:25.124
before you hit the road!

38:27.474 --> 38:28.474
There is also meat.

38:55.174 --> 38:56.524
Does our agreement still count?

39:01.124 --> 39:02.174
Of course.

39:05.249 --> 39:05.874
Brother!

39:05.999 --> 39:06.999
Brother!

39:09.749 --> 39:11.324
Let's not break the wine shop.

39:17.274 --> 39:18.274
Kill her!

39:18.449 --> 39:19.874
This is North Liang.

39:28.074 --> 39:28.825
It's okay.

39:28.849 --> 39:29.849
Go on.

39:30.974 --> 39:31.974
Brother!

39:34.624 --> 39:35.774
(Liang)

39:44.474 --> 39:46.574
(Liang)

40:06.974 --> 40:07.974
Oh no.

40:09.074 --> 40:10.324
It's the North Liang Cavalry.

40:23.274 --> 40:24.699
Do you have to be dead

40:24.723 --> 40:25.974
to drop your sword?

40:30.149 --> 40:31.574
Men are no match for

40:32.274 --> 40:33.824
the North Liang Cavalry.

40:34.884 --> 40:35.899
Drop the weapon.

40:39.874 --> 40:42.500
(Ning Emei, General of Fengzi Battalion)
Ning Emei, General of Fengzi Battalion,

40:42.524 --> 40:43.524
greets Your Highness.

40:59.624 --> 41:00.624
You,

41:00.649 --> 41:01.649
get down.

41:04.874 --> 41:05.874
Dismount from the horse.

41:08.424 --> 41:10.984
No one dares to stand in the way
of the North Liang battle steed.

41:11.799 --> 41:12.799
Get down!

41:20.974 --> 41:22.444
I ask you to dismount.

41:27.574 --> 41:28.574
General Ning!

41:34.349 --> 41:36.219
Someone in the North Liang Army
sent my portrait

41:36.243 --> 41:37.724
to the bandits.

41:38.449 --> 41:39.564
Do you know it?

41:40.099 --> 41:42.363
There is no such person
in the North Liang Army.

41:42.674 --> 41:44.060
All I see is General Ning

41:44.084 --> 41:45.599
trying to kill my friend.

41:45.924 --> 41:47.843
I was ordered
to take Your Highness back home.

41:48.349 --> 41:49.349
Whoever stands in my way

41:49.924 --> 41:50.780
is disobeying the order!

41:50.804 --> 41:52.999
What if I ask you to dismount?

41:54.249 --> 41:55.249
Brother!

41:56.524 --> 41:57.524
Brother!

41:59.099 --> 42:00.099
Brother!

42:00.124 --> 42:01.174
- Brother!
- Your Highness.

42:03.774 --> 42:04.774
Brother.

42:05.624 --> 42:06.624
- Get up.
- Brother.

42:06.774 --> 42:07.774
Let's sit down and talk.

42:09.749 --> 42:10.749
Come on.

42:13.399 --> 42:14.639
Let me take a good look at you.

42:15.124 --> 42:16.124
You've grown up.

42:19.324 --> 42:20.324
Your Highness.

42:20.374 --> 42:21.599
I took the military order

42:21.849 --> 42:23.449
to take His Highness
back to the mansion.

42:28.949 --> 42:30.524
My Huangman'er is here.

42:31.349 --> 42:32.349
I'm tired.

42:33.843 --> 42:34.843
I want to go home.

42:36.124 --> 42:37.124
Well...

42:37.949 --> 42:39.049
Let's go home now.

42:39.849 --> 42:40.849
No hurry.

42:42.974 --> 42:45.074
Let's go home together

42:45.399 --> 42:46.549
after filling our bellies.

42:48.399 --> 42:49.399
Okay.

42:54.163 --> 42:55.163
Waiter!

42:57.249 --> 42:58.274
Bring wine.

44:56.924 --> 45:01.024
♪ The flower of pain ♪
